KataGo @TAG@ for macOS (Apple silicon, Metal backend)

This is an unmodified build of KataGo @TAG@, made from the source at
https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo (tag @TAG@) by the
reallxuan/aji-manifest repository (https://github.com/reallxuan/aji-manifest)
for the Aji KataGo GUI.

The build uses KataGo's Metal backend. It statically links protobuf @PROTOBUF_TAG@
and abseil @ABSEIL_TAG@, so it runs without Homebrew, and it includes the
components KataGo vendors in cpp/external. libzip is not included.

KataGo is distributed under its own licence, in the file LICENSE next to this
note. The licence texts of protobuf, abseil and the other included components
are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt.
